  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1d6ccf6a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Missing values\n",
    "The `start_station_description` column contains 11 000 missing values, while `end_station_description` contains 6950 missing values.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Is this detrimental to our project or analysis?\n",
    "These columns are not truly important for the type of analysing we want to do. Our main objective is to investigate how weather conditions influence bike-sharing usage. Since station ID and names are available, the missing descriptions do not prevent us from identifying stations and analyzing trips. \n",
    "\n",
    "Although they are not required for our current objectives, they could be valuable for other purposes later. In the Gold layer, we can simply exclude columns that are not relevant to are final analytical dataset. "
   ]
  },
