   "source": [
    "Out of the 8 428 152 trips, 25 additional duplicates. \n",
    "\n",
    "#### Are we sure these are duplicates?\n",
    "\n",
    "We can not be certain that these are dublicates because the trips do not contain any identifier. These records do however contain identical entries across all 13 collumns, including timestamp with microseconds precision. It is highly unlikely that separate trips would share all these values.\n",
    "\n",
    "We consider therefore these records to be duplicate entries, potentially from the source data or overlapping records during the ingestion process. The exact cause has not been investigated further, but we want to remove the additional copies. \n",
    "\n",
    "Given that our dataset contain over 8 million trips, removing 25 duplicate records will have a negligible impact on the overall analysis. If the dataset was significanlty smaller, further investigation would be important as removing even a small number of records could have a greater influence on the result."
   ]
  },
